{"from": "claim:lk-02-02-enrollment-timing", "type": "documented_by", "to": "source:wikipedia-governors-syria-early", "note": "The governors before Quirinius: Saturninus (9-7/6 BCE, the governor Tertullian named) and Varus (7/6-4 BCE); Herod's death falls in Varus's term or the unknown succession."}
